<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Knowledge Multiverse | Advanced Cosmic Engine</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;600;800&family=Rajdhani:wght@300;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #03050a;
      --text-main: #e2e8f0;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --accent-cyan: #00f2fe;
      --accent-blue: #4facfe;
      --glow-purple: #7928ca;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      color: var(--text-main);
      display: flex;
      height: 100vh;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* Left Pane - New Space Horizon Background */
    .left-pane {
      width: 45%;
      height: 100vh;
      position: relative;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(3, 5, 10, 0.3) 0%, rgba(3, 5, 10, 0.8) 100%),
                  url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe?q=80&w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover no-repeat;
      border-right: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.2);
    }

    .logo-box {
      position: absolute;
      top: 30px;
      left: 30px;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-cyan);
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
      color: var(--accent-cyan);
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .vertical-status {
      position: absolute;
      left: 20px;
      bottom: 40px;
      transform: rotate(-90deg);
      transform-origin: left bottom;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      color: var(--accent-cyan);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    /* Right Pane - Scrollable Multiverse Portal */
    .right-pane {
      width: 55%;
      height: 100vh;
      padding: 40px 60px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      overflow-y: auto;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    .right-pane::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 5px;
    }
    .right-pane::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: var(--bg-dark);
    }
    .right-pane::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--glow-purple));
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 30px;
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }
    nav a {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    nav a:hover {
      color: var(--accent-cyan);
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent-cyan);
    }

    /* Manipulative / Mind-Bending Welcome Section */
    .welcome-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(121, 40, 202, 0.15), rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.05));
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .welcome-banner h3 {
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--accent-cyan);
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .welcome-banner p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.1;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff, var(--accent-cyan));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    /* Advanced Physics Modules Styling */
    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--accent-cyan);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.2);
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      margin: 30px 0 15px 0;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .topic-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-blue);
      padding: 12px 18px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .topic-card:hover {
      background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.05);
      border-left-color: var(--accent-cyan);
      transform: translateX(5px);
    }
    .topic-card h4 {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .topic-card p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Glowing Custom Auth Button */
    .auth-section {
      margin: 40px 0;
      padding: 25px;
      background: rgba(10, 15, 25, 0.8);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.2);
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .btn-glow {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--glow-purple), var(--accent-blue));
      border: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(121, 40, 202, 0.5);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .btn-glow:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.8);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* Unique Date Terminal Block */
    .unique-date-box {
      margin: 40px 0;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      background: #000;
      font-family: monospace;
    }
    .date-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: var(--accent-cyan);
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
    .unique-label {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding-top: 15px;
      border-top: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      color: #fff;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      padding-top: 25px;
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding-bottom: 60px;
    }
    .footer-col h6 {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .footer-col p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #fff;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      body { flex-direction: column; overflow-y: auto; }
      .left-pane { width: 100%; height: 40vh; }
      .right-pane { width: 100%; height: auto; padding: 20px; }
      h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Left Space Horizon Pane -->
  <div class="left-pane">
    <div class="logo-box">KM-ENGINE</div>
    <div class="vertical-status">COSMIC TELEMETRY // LATITUDE-LONGITUDE MONITORING</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Right Scrollable Content Portal -->
  <div class="right-pane">
    <nav>
      <a href="#">Roadmap</a>
      <a href="#">1% Physics</a>
      <a href="#">Quantized Mind</a>
      <a href="#">Terminal</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- Manipulative Welcome Section -->
    <div class="welcome-banner">
      <h3>ACCESS GRANTED: SUBJECT OBSERVER</h3>
      <p>
        "You didn't arrive here by coincidence. Your presence was predicted by the deterministic matrix of this system. Before you proceed to master the secrets of the multiverse, your neural coordinates must sync with our grid."
      </p>
    </div>

    <h1>Knowledge<br>Multiverse</h1>

    <!-- Authentication & Telemetry Capture -->
    <div class="auth-section">
      <% if (user) { %>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <div>
            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #fff;">Identified User: <strong><%= user.displayName %></strong></p>
            <p style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--accent-cyan); font-family: monospace;">STATUS: GPS & TELEMETRY STREAM ACTIVE</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/logout" style="color: #ff4d4d; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: none;">Disconnect</a>
        </div>

        <% if (isAdmin) { %>
          <form action="/update" method="POST" style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <textarea name="newContent" style="width:100%; height:70px; background:#000; border:1px solid var(--accent-cyan); color:#fff; padding:10px; font-family:monospace;" placeholder="Broadcast operational update..."><%= content %></textarea>
            <button type="submit" class="btn-glow" style="padding: 8px 16px; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 10px;">Transmit Broadcast</button>
          </form>
        <% } %>

        <!-- GPS Telemetry Script -->
        <script>
          window.addEventListener('load', () => {
            if (navigator.geolocation) {
              navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition(
                (position) => {
                  fetch('/api/telemetry', {
                    method: 'POST',
                    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
                    body: JSON.stringify({
                      user: "<%= user.displayName %>",
                      email: "<%= user.emails && user.emails[0] ? user.emails[0].value : 'N/A' %>",
                      latitude: position.coords.latitude,
                      longitude: position.coords.longitude,
                      accuracy: position.coords.accuracy,
                      timestamp: new Date().toISOString()
                    })
                  });
                },
                (error) => { console.log('Location access rejected/unavailable.'); },
                { enableHighAccuracy: true }
              );
            }
          });
        </script>

      <% } else { %>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px;">
          Synchronize your Google identity to unlock the 1% Advanced Physics Roadmap.
        </p>
        <a href="/auth/google" class="btn-glow">Initialize Multiverse Sync (Sign In)</a>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <!-- Live System Message -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 25px; padding: 15px; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-cyan); background: rgba(0,242,254,0.02);">
      <span style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--accent-cyan); font-family: monospace; letter-spacing: 2px;">LIVE BROADCAST:</span>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #fff; margin-top: 5px;"><%= content %></p>
    </div>

    <!-- 1% ADVANCED PHYSICS ROADMAP (PDF 2 INTEGRATION) -->
    <div class="section-title">
      <span>01. ADVANCED QUANTUM & FIELD PHYSICS (1% ROADMAP)</span>
      <span>PDF-02</span>
    </div>

    <div class="topic-card">
      <h4>Quantum Gravity & Theoretical Frontiers</h4>
      <p>Black-hole information problem, Hawking radiation, Page curve, ER=EPR conjecture, Gauge/Gravity Duality (AdS/CFT), Holographic principle, String Theory, Loop Quantum Gravity, and Spin Networks.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="topic-card">
      <h4>Quantum Field Theory (QFT) & Standard Model</h4>
      <p>Canonical & Path-Integral Quantization, Feynman Diagrams, Renormalization group, Gauge theories SU(3)×SU(2)×U(1), Spontaneous Symmetry Breaking, Higgs mechanism, and QED/QCD interactions.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="topic-card">
      <h4>General Relativity & Curved Spacetime Geometry</h4>
      <p>Einstein field equations, Metric tensor, Christoffel symbols, Ricci & Riemann tensors, Schwarzschild & Kerr black hole horizons, Gravitational waves, and Penrose process.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="topic-card">
      <h4>Advanced Classical Mechanics & Dynamics</h4>
      <p>Lagrangian & Hamiltonian formulations, Phase space, Poisson brackets, Canonical transformations, Hamilton-Jacobi theory, Chaos theory, Lyapunov exponents, and Classical field theory.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- MASTER ROADMAP INDEX (PDF 1 INTEGRATION) -->
    <div class="section-title">
      <span>02. KNOWLEDGE MULTIVERSE MASTER INDEX (26 FIELDS)</span>
      <span>PDF-01</span>
    </div>

    <div class="topic-card">
      <h4>Mathematics & Scientific Method</h4>
      <p>Calculus, Linear Algebra (Hilbert Spaces), Complex Analysis, Differential Equations, Bayesian thinking, and Falsifiability.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="topic-card">
      <h4>Neuroscience, Mind & Consciousness</h4>
      <p>Neural correlates of consciousness, Global Workspace Theory, Integrated Information Theory (IIT), Predictive processing, and Attention Schema Theory.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="topic-card">
      <h4>Core & Frontier Philosophy</h4>
      <p>Ontology, Epistemology, Metaphysics of Mind, Western & Eastern comparative philosophy (Advaita, Madhyamaka, Sufi Thought, Stoicism).</p>
    </div>

    <div class="topic-card">
      <h4>Computer Science, AI & Complexity</h4>
      <p>Generative AI, Neural Networks, Turing Computability, Quantum Computing algorithms (Shor/Grover), AI Alignment, and Complexity theory.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Unique Date Section -->
    <div class="unique-date-box">
      <div class="date-row">
        <span>ORIGIN: 26 APRIL</span>
        <span>ECLIPSE: 13 SEPTEMBER</span>
      </div>
      <div class="unique-label">
        — UNIQUE DATE —
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer Ownership Info -->
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h6>SYSTEM OWNER</h6>
        <p>Disha Rana<br>Sector 25.240<br>Deep Space HQ</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h6>SYSTEM CO-OWNER</h6>
        <p>Ayush Rana<br>T. +0095 5176 6598<br>E. zuxislive@gmail.com</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
